304
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:06,000
Therefore, it is recommended that you add a fixed pin

305
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:09,000
Select and rename it in the property editor

306
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:13,000
In this way, you can quickly select the fixed pin that needs to be edited

307
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:17,000
To control the transition between key pins and adjust the animation speed

308
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:19,000
