00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:24,000
Right-click on the key pin

312
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:27,000
Then select the transition effect from the menu

313
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:30,000
The long-term transition effect will maintain the current transition effect unchanged

314
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:33,000
Until the next key pin is switched to the corresponding effect

315
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:35,000
To make immediate changes

316
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:39,000
The linear transition effect uses the function of connecting different key pins with a straight line

317
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:42,000
To make a smooth and stable transition

318
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:49,000
The three-time transition effect uses the function of connecting the key pins with a curved line

319
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:51,000
To achieve a more dynamic transition effect

320
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:55,000
When using three or more key pins, this function is especially effective

321
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:57,000
Because the transition looks more natural

322
00:14:57,000 --> 00:15:01,000
